{"study_accession":"PRJNA767371","secondary_study_accession":"SRP339313","title":"The expression of mRNA and lncRNA in peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) of diabetes mellitus, diabetic retinopathy (DR), diabetic peripheral neuropathy (DPN) and diabetic nephropathy (DN) patients","description":"DR, DPN and DN are common complications in diabetes, and the differentially expressed mRNAs and lncRNAs in these diabetic complications may help to identify the molecular markers for the onset and progression of diseases. In our study, high-throughput sequencing technique was used to analyze the expression profile of mRNA and lncRNA in the peripheral blood of health control, T2DM, DR, DPN and DN patients, in order to determine the differentially expressed transcriptomic profiles changes in diabetic complications and identify the shared and specific biological signaling pathways related to DR, DPN and DN. Overall design: mRNA and lncRNA transcriptional spectrums of peripheral blood mononuclear cells in health control, T2DM, DR, DPN and DN patients were obtained through high-throughput sequencingene technology.","pubmed":"35989592","geo_series":"","n_samples":25,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN21899657","study_accession":"PRJNA767371","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"Peripheral blood_DN_rep4","description":"Peripheral blood_DN_rep4","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5603450","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-11-13","attributes":[["source_name","Peripheral blood mononuclear cells"],["tissue","Peripheral blood mononuclear cells"],["age","63y"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR16118149","experiment_accession":"SRX12403650","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":42007244,"base_count":12602173200,"first_public":"2022-11-13","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM5603450: Peripheral blood_DN_rep4 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{